ecord on La Salle Parish runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids April to May and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle ran 36% of normal for November to December and 59% for October to November. So far in 2026 it ran 47% for January to February and 199% for May to June. On grid 13651 the preliminary estimate for July to August 2026 is 58.6.</p>"}
